$translate — multilingual text translation (M2M100 1.2B)

SUMMARY
  Translates each texts[] item (or prompts[]) from scr= to dst= using facebook/m2m100_1.2B
  (100 languages, many-to-many).

SYNTAX
  $translate(scr='ru', dst='en')
  $translate(src='ru', dst='en')
  $translate(scr='zh', dst='fr', gpu=True)

INPUT
  texts[]   — source strings (preferred)
  prompts[] — used when texts[] is empty

OUTPUT
  texts[] — one translated .txt per input item

ARGUMENTS
  scr= / src= — source language code (required), e.g. ru, en, zh, fr, de, ja
  dst=        — target language code (required)
  model=      — default | m2m100 | 1.2b (all use models/m2m100_1.2B/)
  max_length= — generation cap (default 512)
  gpu=        — use CUDA when true (default: auto-detect, or AH_TRANSLATE_GPU=1)

MODELS
  models/m2m100_1.2B/ — ~4.7 GB pytorch_model.bin + sentencepiece.bpe.model
  First run downloads automatically from skreling-eng/anthill or facebook/m2m100_1.2B.

DEPENDENCIES
  uv sync --extra media   (torch, transformers, sentencepiece)

ENVIRONMENT
  AH_EMULATE_TRANSLATE=1 — placeholder text, no model load.
  AH_TRANSLATE_GPU=1     — default gpu=True when arg omitted.

EXAMPLE
  @ru_en: $file('note.txt') -> $translate(scr='ru', dst='en') -> $save('en.txt')

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No — input texts[] are replaced with translations.
